WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
- I'd like to order a private plane.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.000
Destinations Miami, San Fran, Vegas, Foxb—

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
What is that noise?!

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.750
- It's easy money, and you barely have to play.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.166
- Yeah, but Indianapolis?

00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:10.541
- Beer me, Aaron!
[Crashing and fizzing]

00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:13.791
- Looks like that one hit..."LaFloor." Hahahaha.

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:15.500
- Why is your body making those noises?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.875
- I'm doing a laughing, Tom.

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:18.916
I'm happy! Turns out during the playoffs,

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:21.625
everyone else stays in Gridiron Heights and gets along.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:22.625
Have a cold one.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:25.125
- Why? To be relatable on late-night TV?

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.375
- Everyone's welcome. Isn't that right, Russ?

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.500
We also got catering.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.625
- The Jets are happy to sponsor the offseason dance contest...

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.791
...for the 12th straight year!
[Cheering]

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:36.625
- I wish Super Bowl expectations were this low!

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:38.250
- Could've been worse.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.250
- I love it here.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.875
- Look, look, watch.

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.500
Du...falllll.

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:47.125
- It's all good. I'm about to be Kirk Cousins rich.

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.750
- Look, the kickers parade's starting.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.166
- [Crowd:] It's OK, we blame Dak!

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:53.791
- Sorry we weren't here sooner.

00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:55.666
We accidentally beat the Bucs.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:58.125
- Is it really not all about winning?

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:00.875
- Yo, we're trying to rest for the playoffs that we're still in.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.041
- Our...apologies...

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:04.750
- Losing sucks!

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.000
- Everyone, get them!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.875
- [All:] Aaaaaah!

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:16.291
- So, uh...how...how's Davante?

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:18.541
- Oh, you, uh, didn't hear? We broke up.

00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:20.958
- Oh, wow, that's...I'm sorry to hear that.

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:24.041
- Yeah, well, think he never got over an old flame.

00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:25.250
Go to him, Aaron.
[Romantic music swells]

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:25.666
- But-

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:28.916
- I wouldn't be Derek Carr if I didn't love love.

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:31.000
Now, go to him before it's too late.

